WEBVTT

00:00:00.941 --> 00:00:03.949
This fresh job hires a deliberately faulty worker.

00:00:06.959 --> 00:00:09.007
This faulty version corrupts a result.

00:00:11.127 --> 00:00:15.842
The budget is reserved under independent checks. Failed work must not be paid.

00:00:24.843 --> 00:00:30.795
The new job is funded. Both executions run privately. This recording includes the real wait.

00:00:45.596 --> 00:00:49.009
The checker rejected the result. The budget was refunded.

00:00:50.695 --> 00:00:53.298
This is the refund for the job just created.

00:00:55.789 --> 00:00:57.368
Check directly against Near.

00:00:58.826 --> 00:01:01.621
The outcome, recipient and downloaded code match.

00:01:05.502 --> 00:01:12.265
This checks public consistency. Full hardware verification and invoice authenticity remain separate checks.
